From d3da714ec000883a34c29c77ab94341e91c5cccc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hubert Hickman <hubert.hickman@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:51:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] passwords.cpp: include <stdlib.h> for exit() and
 realloc()

passwords.cpp calls exit() and realloc() but only includes Arduino.h,
getting <stdlib.h> indirectly through <string>. libc++ 23 (Emscripten
7.0 and later) no longer includes it that way, so the file stopped
compiling there. Include what it uses. No change for other builds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ESPHamClock/ArduinoLib/passwords.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/ESPHamClock/ArduinoLib/passwords.cpp b/ESPHamClock/ArduinoLib/passwords.cpp
index 620feb6..54516a1 100644
--- a/ESPHamClock/ArduinoLib/passwords.cpp
+++ b/ESPHamClock/ArduinoLib/passwords.cpp
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
  */
 
 #include "Arduino.h"
+#include <stdlib.h>                     // exit(), realloc(): no longer reached through <string> in libc++ 23
 
 
 /* store category and hashed password pairs
